ons. StatisMed. 2007;26(9):2088&#x02013;112, Apr 30. </citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn><p>I. Dr. Chien is supported by a Career Development Award from the Agency for Healthcare Research and Quality (K08 HS17146-01).</p><p>II. Dr. Chin is supported by a Midcareer Investigator Award in Patient-Oriented Research (K24 DK071933) and a Diabetes Research and Training Center (P60 DK20595) from the National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>